I am a part of the constituency of Loglanders who are now lojbanistani. 
I believe there are others who shared my interest in Loglan and would 
now share my interest in lojban. I believe that addressing the 
Loglan/lojban schism in some manner would reassure others like me who 
have not yet joined the lojban community. Who are you to contradict my 
point-of-view? Did you memorize all the predicates of Loglan only to 
find those predicates discarded in toto?

How does your hostility further your stated goal of preserving the 
lojban baseline?

